# hooks/plan-carrier-guard.mjs uses literal NUL bytes as a cache-key separator, so git
# guesses "binary" and stops diffing it — which for a repo whose whole purpose is to carry
# edits between two machines is the worst possible guess: no readable diff in a review, and
# no textual merge when both laptops touched it. These are source files; say so.
*.mjs text diff
*.sh  text diff
*.json text diff
*.md  text diff
